WEBVTT

1
00:00.300 --> 00:05.200
Magpie lets you borrow SOL against tokens you already hold — without selling them.

2
00:08.200 --> 00:14.260
This is magpie.capital. Three collateral classes: memecoins, tokenized stocks & RWAs, and collectibles.

3
00:14.460 --> 00:22.770
Hit Dashboard and connect your wallet. Everything lives in one place.

4
00:23.170 --> 00:27.530
Balances, eligible collateral, active loans, and your credit score — all live.

5
00:27.930 --> 00:30.730
A live loan: 7.7 SOL against WIF — fixed term, no margin calls.

6
00:30.930 --> 00:41.030
Our flagship — V4 exit orders. A 3-leg take-profit ladder + a stop-loss, armed. They fire in-vault while your loan stays active.

7
00:43.510 --> 00:47.180
Repay any time — and build credit as you go.

8
00:47.880 --> 00:56.480
Prefer chat? The Telegram bot does everything the dashboard does — borrow, extend, repay — right from your phone.

9
00:57.380 --> 01:03.180
Collateral that can still sell itself. Start today at magpie.capital.
